# {{ app_name }} Runtime

This directory is the complete deployable application.

```bash
uv sync --extra test
uv run pytest
uv run python -m {{ package_name }}.cli serve
uv run python -m {{ package_name }}.cli chat
```

The runtime owns its business contract, application policy, service adapters, tools, selected model artifacts, knowledge-base artifacts, configuration, tests, and deployment manifest.

Runtime readiness validates the approved packaged application contract, release schema, configured package identity, and the exact hashes and byte counts of promoted policy and runtime artifacts.

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` to configure `{{ package_name | upper }}_HOST`, `{{ package_name | upper }}_PORT`, and `{{ package_name | upper }}_LOG_LEVEL`. The root Make targets accept `HOST` and `PORT` overrides.
